# Cloudflare Pages: the Studio is a single-page app under /studio/. Deep links
# (e.g. /studio/c/projects) rewrite to its shell with a 200 so reloads and
# shared links work. Everything else is a real static file.
/studio/* /studio/index.html 200

# The blog became Notes (the Ground Truth redesign). Old links keep working.
/blog /notes/ 301
/blog/ /notes/ 301
/blog/tags/* /notes/ 301
/blog/* /notes/:splat 301
